  41:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_q31.c ****  * @param[in] *S points to an instance of the Q31 FIR filter structure.
  42:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_q31.c ****  * @param[in] *pSrc points to the block of input data.
