  91:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_q31.c ****    *    acc1 =  b[numTaps-1] * x[n-numTaps] +   b[numTaps-2] * x[n-numTaps-1] + b[numTaps-3] * x[n-
  92:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_q31.c ****    *    acc2 =  b[numTaps-1] * x[n-numTaps+1] + b[numTaps-2] * x[n-numTaps] +   b[numTaps-3] * x[n-
  93:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_q31.c ****    *    acc3 =  b[numTaps-1] * x[n-numTaps+2] + b[numTaps-2] * x[n-numTaps+1] + b[numTaps-3] * x[n-
